{"slug": "about-us", "title": "About Humblebee - Digital Service Design Studio — Humblebee", "desc": "Humblebee is a studio of designers and engineers helping companies navigate a rapidly changing world. We work hard and have fun doing what we do.", "template": "legacy", "html": "<div class=\"main-wrapper\"><section><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"padding-section-xlarge\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-xsmall\"><h1>Hello. We&#x27;re Humblebee.</h1></div><div class=\"w-layout-grid header_component is-services\"><div class=\"services-content is-left\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-xsmall\"><h4>A digital studio working with ambitious international companies.<br/></h4></div></div><div class=\"services_image-wrapper\"><img src=\"/assets/images/about_oday.jpg\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"1215\" alt=\"Mobile UI/UX\" class=\"services_image\"/></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section_header\"><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"padding-section-large\"><div class=\"w-layout-grid header_component\"><div class=\"header_image-wrapper\"><img src=\"/assets/images/about-1.webp\" loading=\"eager\" alt=\"Humblebee Team\" class=\"header_image\"/></div><div class=\"header_content\"><div class=\"header_content-wrapper\"><h4 class=\"heading-45\">We&#x27;re a diverse team. We love what we do and have fun doing it. </h4></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section_content background-color-grey\"><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"padding-section-large\"><div class=\"content_component\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-xxlarge\"><div class=\"max-width-large\"><h2>Our Values</h2></div></div><div class=\"w-layout-grid content_list\"><div class=\"layout242_item\"><h3>Diversity</h3><p>We believe diversity means different opinions leading to a better atmosphere and fostering creativity.</p></div><div class=\"layout242_item\"><h3>Equality</h3><p>Everyone&#x27;s opinion is of equal importance at Humblebee and everyone has the opportunity to develop.</p></div><div class=\"layout242_item\"><h3>Respect</h3><p>We work in collaborative teams and we respect our fellow colleagues and partners at all times.</p></div><div class=\"layout242_item\"><h3>Co-creation</h3><p>Co-creation is the key to success. We put the right experts in a room and great things happen.</p></div><div class=\"layout242_item\"><h3>Speed</h3><p>Speed to get services to market is a differentiator for smart companies and brings competitive advantage.<br/></p></div><div class=\"layout242_item\"><h3>No Bullsh*t</h3><p>We always aim to find and build what&#x27;s needed, not always what&#x27;s asked for. We always give our customers honest straight talk.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section_header\"><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"padding-section-large\"><div class=\"w-layout-grid header_component\"><div class=\"header_image-wrapper\"><img src=\"/assets/images/about-2.webp\" loading=\"eager\" alt=\"Conference\" class=\"header_image\"/></div><div class=\"header_content\"><div><h3 class=\"heading-60\">Hive - our program for international students</h3><p>Hive is our student lab. We assemble a team of international students to tackle a challenge. This team has 6 months to design and develop a digital service to address a real-world challenge. Students are given mentors in respective fields and are based alongside Humblebee at our lovely Gothenburg, Sweden HQ.</p><div class=\"margin-top margin-small\"><div class=\"button-group\"><a href=\"/hive\" class=\"button is-link is-icon w-inline-block\"><div>Apply to HIVE</div><div class=\"icon-embed-xsmall w-embed\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"34\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 34 16\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 8L33.0286 8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" 